English word lists (internal/worddata/en/)
------------------------------------------

Derived from top-english-wordlists by david47k.

- Source: https://github.com/david47k/top-english-wordlists
- License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported (CC-BY 3.0)
- License URL: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Changes made for tale: filtered by length and character set, deduplicated
inflected forms, ranked within buckets, and split by initial letter and
part of speech.

Spanish word lists (internal/worddata/es/)
------------------------------------------

Derived from frequency.csv in doozan/spanish_data, which in turn derives from
FrequencyWords (hermitdave/FrequencyWords).

- Sources:
  - https://github.com/doozan/spanish_data
  - https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords
- License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC-BY-SA 3.0)
- License URL: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Changes made for tale: lemma selection, frequency filtering, diminutive
exclusion, accent normalization, and re-bucketing by initial letter and part
of speech. The curated files in internal/worddata/es/ are distributed under
CC-BY-SA 3.0.

Semantic embeddings (internal/worddata/{en,es}/embeddings.bin)
--------------------------------------------------------------

Quantized vectors for the words above, extracted from fastText Common Crawl
vectors and stored in tale's own binary format.

- Source: https://fasttext.cc/ (cc.en.300.vec, cc.es.300.vec)
- License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported (CC-BY-SA 3.0)
- License URL: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Changes made for tale: restricted to embedded vocabulary words, int8
quantization with per-vector scale, L2 normalization at load time. Regenerate
with `make embeddings` (maintainers, requires network).
